generator STRUCTURAL "Instrument-fault, meteorological-variability, regional-depletion and chemical-loss rivals"
rival LIVE "Instrument/calibration explanation for unexpectedly low ozone"
rival LIVE "Meteorological explanation for the seasonal pattern"
residue HIGH "Regional extent and chemical causal mechanism are not yet identified by this packet"
